      "readme_sha": "74d28cbcabad5fefa7e37e0214128782f0ecb85c",
      "readme_excerpt": "Multitenancy and Extensibility Tool is a cli to reduce operational overhead for multitenant Cloud Foundry applications, particularly in the areas user authentication, tenant registration, CAP multitenancy, and HANA container management. Prerequisite is an installed CF cli v8 or newer. **Prepare** npm install --global @cap-js-community/mtx-tool mtx --setup **Use, for example** cf target -o <my-org> -s <my-space> mtx regl mtx hdil For pipelines, we recommend committing the setup configuration to your project and running MTX Tool on the pipeline runner in the corresponding directory through npx with a stable version: **In project** mtx --setup-local git add . && git commit -m \"mtx-tool",
